Text_PictureBookShelf:
	.string "There's a set of POKéMON picture books.$"

Text_BookShelf:
	.string "It's filled with all sorts of books.$"

Text_PokemonCenterBookShelf:
	.string "POKéMON magazines! POKéGOSSIP,\n"
	.string "crossword puzzles…\p"
	.string "Wait, something 18+? PLAYMON? Why is\n"
	.string "there a LOPUNNY posing on the cover?\p"
	.string "Why are people staring at me like this?$"

Text_Vase:
	.string "This vase looks expensive…\n"
	.string "Peered inside…\p"
	.string "But, it was empty.$"

Text_EmptyTrashCan:
	.string "It's empty.$"

Text_ShopShelf:
	.string "The shelves are full of POKéMON\n"
	.string "merchandise.\p"
	.string "Birthday cards, coffee cups, oversized\n"
	.string "plushies.\p"
	.string "Imagine having huge DRAGAPULT, GALAR\n"
	.string "ARTICUNO and COFAGRIGUS plushies at\l"
	.string "home.\p"
	.string "Wait…$"

Text_Blueprint:
	.string "A blueprint of some sort?\n"
	.string "It's too complicated!$"
